    S1 & S2 & S3 & S4 & S5 & S6 & S7 -.inherits.-> BA
    BA --> RT
    BA --> PROFILES

    ORCH --> ER & GAT
    ER --> CONSENSUS
    GAT --> CONSENSUS
    CONSENSUS --> CONS_BUILD
    CONS_BUILD --> MCDA

    T1 & T2 & T3 & T4 & T5 & T6 --> LLM_INT
    S1 & S2 & S3 & S4 & S5 & S6 & S7 --> LLM_INT
    LLM_INT --> CLAUDE & OPENAI & LMSTUDIO
    LLM_INT --> PROMPTS

    MCDA --> METRICS
    METRICS --> VIS
    VIS --> VIZ
    VIZ --> JSON_OUT

    VALID -.validates.-> JSON_IN
    CONFIG -.configures.-> COORD & LLM_INT

